WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.780
Move your microphone closer. Keep the input

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:06.160
below clipping. Keep the input below clipping.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:10.600
Record 10 seconds of room tone. Do

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.300
not remove every breath. Listen for background

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:16.560
noise. Turn off the loud ceiling fan.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.580
Turn off the loud ceiling fan. Check

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.560
your headphones before recording. Save a copy

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:25.200
of the original.